  "body": "## What\n\nAdd the case `examples/catalog/multiaxis/wrapped`: a cylinder with a wrapped groove. It shows Rotary Contour, Rotary Parallel and Rotary Offset on the A axis.\n\nDone means: The case folder obeys `examples/catalog/README.md`: `model/` with its generator script, `build.camscript`, `<case>.camproj`, `<case>.nc` and `README.md`. The geometry is original (Clean-Room Protocol). `cargo xtask catalog --check` and `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog` pass. The README says what the case shows and what to look at. The posted program shows the A axis moves.\n\nFile each refusal or wrong output that the work finds as its own bug. Link the bug on #2392. A missing parameter in an MCP tool is a new `area:mcp` issue.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
